      "en": "Folly is set in great dignity, and the rich sit in a low place.",
      "ko": "우매자가 크게 높은 지위를 얻고 부자가 낮은 지위에 앉는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "42fcbfd45889763bfbc6e36d60dca8a59cb69c15e6c76665d7383ad0d873bf9b",
      "translation_text_hash": "ef2a0f3a5a0b36831bf4f98d7f272cbf99484587972d95435851a519baef7f57",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
