      "en": "He who digs a pit may fall into it; and whoever breaks through a wall may be bitten by a snake.",
      "ko": "함정을 파는 자는 거기 빠질 것이요 담을 허는 자는 뱀에게 물리리라",
      "source_text_hash": "442cabd0fda23fe4bb11d0228e6a1d8f06c1d4f8d1cb6a7e18166ac7659e7d63",
      "translation_text_hash": "a9ae5c3b717aa87c33f7950040318e75b95d2a191f387da22647b0d1c67670bc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
