      "en": "If the snake bites before it is charmed, then is there no profit for the charmer’s tongue.",
      "ko": "방술을 베풀기 전에 뱀에게 물렸으면 술객은 무용하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "16fc1dccede211872098bce1e247080ef5cb38ac4927e7cf6da250fce109c4a3",
      "translation_text_hash": "c0fa243f5e17aa70279b9d959a9e6d607b5ceae8e28e519fc1781029e9335284",
