      "en": "The words of a wise man’s mouth are gracious; but a fool is swallowed by his own lips.",
      "ko": "지혜자의 입의 말은 은혜로우나 우매자의 입술은 자기를 삼키나니",
      "source_text_hash": "6ce3295a2fbbcdf759d6a9e683d4f00cada02876f931513137b0a0e978949398",
      "translation_text_hash": "62883592b2c88ce66d17f718b21699e5a696f8bbd5a09846d3e5aa4ac5cadc38",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
